Scenario: A parent with no configured environment delegates an API migration and follows up after idle eviction. Each worker result wakes the parent for a turn of its own. The worker temporarily attaches a workspace, then resumes with no environment and its earlier answer. Complete model streams are grouped as parent, then worker.

